more&quot; print ( list (sections(doc))) print ([ len (w) for w in windows( &quot;y&quot; * 1451 )]) Output: 1 2 3 [(&#x27;&#x27;, &#x27;intro&#x27;), (&#x27;A&#x27;, &#x27;# A
